{
  "id": "6af3248d38fd0c71f4188215",
  "title": "弱化記法",
  "created": 1794319505,
  "updated": 1794405558,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6af3248d38fd0c71f4188215",
      "text": "弱化記法",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319505,
      "updated": 1794319505
    },
    {
      "id": "6af325730000000000e9efdb",
      "text": "書式：`[-# text]`",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319732,
      "updated": 1794319755
    },
    {
      "id": "6af325730000000000e9efdc",
      "text": "記号：[-#]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319732,
      "updated": 1794319746
    },
    {
      "id": "6af325730000000000e9efdd",
      "text": "製作者：[h45te.icon]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319732,
      "updated": 1794319740
    },
    {
      "id": "6af325740000000000e9efde",
      "text": "参考: [打ち消し線記法]、[グリッチUserCSS]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319733,
      "updated": 1794319976
    },
    {
      "id": "6af3264b0000000000e9efe2",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319948,
      "updated": 1794319948
    },
    {
      "id": "6af325250000000000e9efd7",
      "text": " 雰囲気で作ってみた",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319654,
      "updated": 1794319743
    },
    {
      "id": "6af3253b0000000000e9efd9",
      "text": "  主張を弱くする記法が欲しかった",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319676,
      "updated": 1794319694
    },
    {
      "id": "6af325e70000000000e9efe1",
      "text": " [- たぶん井戸端でそのまま導入すると上手く動かない]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319848,
      "updated": 1794320030
    },
    {
      "id": "6af3269d0000000000e10ed4",
      "text": "  なんか動いた",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794320030,
      "updated": 1794320034
    },
    {
      "id": "6af326a50000000000e10ed5",
      "text": " ダークモードに対応できているかは不明",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794320038,
      "updated": 1794320068
    },
    {
      "id": "6af3282400000000002907fa",
      "text": " 導入していないと通常の打ち消し線と被ってよくないかも",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794320421,
      "updated": 1794320452
    },
    {
      "id": "6af3284300000000002907fb",
      "text": "  代わりを検討しよう",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794320452,
      "updated": 1794320452
    },
    {
      "id": "6af325250000000000e9efd8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319654,
      "updated": 1794319654
    },
    {
      "id": "6af324910000000000e9efc8",
      "text": " [-# -#を付けて書くと字が薄くなります]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319506,
      "updated": 1794320542
    },
    {
      "id": "6af3280f00000000002907f9",
      "text": "  文字の不透明度を落としている",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794320400,
      "updated": 1794320410
    },
    {
      "id": "6af324a20000000000e9efc9",
      "text": "  [Discord]の記法",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319523,
      "updated": 1794319707
    },
    {
      "id": "6af474b100000000002204f3",
      "text": "   subtextというらしい",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794405554,
      "updated": 1794405558
    },
    {
      "id": "6af328aa00000000007ae110",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794320555,
      "updated": 1794320555
    },
    {
      "id": "6af328a100000000007ae10e",
      "text": " [https://gyazo.com/4063198778923398e3778dce0deedb8e]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794320545,
      "updated": 1794320550
    },
    {
      "id": "6af328a100000000007ae10f",
      "text": " [https://gyazo.com/9cc1014c324b0677b3d42ca5ddc24346]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794320545,
      "updated": 1794320550
    },
    {
      "id": "6af324a20000000000e9efca",
      "text": "  ダークモード若干ずんぐりしてるか？",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319523,
      "updated": 1794320567
    },
    {
      "id": "6af328ad00000000007ae111",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794320557,
      "updated": 1794320557
    },
    {
      "id": "6af324a20000000000e9efcb",
      "text": "code:style.css",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319523,
      "updated": 1794319523
    },
    {
      "id": "6af324a20000000000e9efcc",
      "text": " .line strike { text-decoration: none !important; }",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319523,
      "updated": 1794319523
    },
    {
      "id": "6af324a20000000000e9efcd",
      "text": " .line .deco-- {",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319523,
      "updated": 1794319523
    },
    {
      "id": "6af324a20000000000e9efce",
      "text": " \t\ttext-decoration: line-through;",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319523,
      "updated": 1794319523
    },
    {
      "id": "6af324a20000000000e9efcf",
      "text": " }",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319523,
      "updated": 1794319523
    },
    {
      "id": "6af324a20000000000e9efd0",
      "text": " .line .deco--.deco-\\# {",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319523,
      "updated": 1794319523
    },
    {
      "id": "6af324a20000000000e9efd1",
      "text": " \t\ttext-decoration: none !important;",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319523,
      "updated": 1794319523
    },
    {
      "id": "6af324a20000000000e9efd2",
      "text": " \t\topacity: .8;",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319523,
      "updated": 1794319523
    },
    {
      "id": "6af324a20000000000e9efd3",
      "text": " }",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1794319523,
      "updated": 1794319523
